{
  "$comment": "Stands in for GET /api/v1/admin/users/vocabularies. Labels, tones, the profile schema, the metric definitions and the open decisions this module renders on screen. The panel reads ALL of this rather than hard-coding it, so a profile field, a tag, a registration source or a metric caution added server-side renders with no code edit. Static copy (labels, help text, cautions) is permanent; nothing in this file is a placeholder record.",
