  "$comment_businessFacets": "FOUR FACETS, NOT ONE HIERARCHY. businessType says what kind of entity this is, segments says what it does, categories says how it engages and for which sector, and searchKeywords is the discovery long tail. They are deliberately orthogonal: 'Manufacturer + Modular kitchen' and 'Service provider + Modular kitchen' are different businesses and the pair is what says so. businessType is a CLOSED list because the marketplace ranks on it; segments and categories are OPEN with a suggestion list, because a typed segment nobody anticipated is still a fact about the business — and the closed/open split is one flag per field in profileFields. searchKeywords is open because matching is the one job where the long tail is the point.",
